      "text": [
        " رِوَايَةِ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ أَحْمَدَ بْنِ يَحْيَى عَنْ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ اَلْحُسَيْنِ عَنْ عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ بْنِ اَلْمُغِيرَةِ عَمَّنْ ذَكَرَ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : أَنَّهُ قَالَ فِي تَفْسِيرِ هَذِهِ اَلْآيَةِ\n۝ إِذَا رَأَيْتُمُوهُمْ يُحِبُّونَ آلَ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِمُ اَلسَّلاَمُ فَارْفَعُوهُمْ دَرَجَةً ۝."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5524 - In the narration of Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn Yahya from Muhammad ibn Al-Husayn from Abdullah ibn Al-Mughira from someone who mentioned from Abu Abdullah (as), that Imam (as) said in the interpretation of this verse:\n\"If you perceive in them sound judgment, then deliver their wealth to them\"\n(Surah An-Nisa 4:6).\nImam (as) said: \"If you see that they love the family of Muhammad (sw), peace be upon them, then elevate them in status.\""
        ]
      }
